id=composite-fk-skipped
class=logic
found=the 2026-10 read-only review, 2026-10-21
fixed=0.5.2
test=test/01_limit_runway.sql
detail=limit_runway_findings() and limit_runway_sample() joined conkey[1] to confkey[1] and filtered
       cardinality(conkey) = 1, so a composite foreign key was skipped in silence. An int4 child
       column referencing a bigint parent column produced no finding, and nothing said the key had
       not been read. test/01 builds a composite key whose first pair is int4 -> bigint; this patch
       must make that assertion fail.
